WEBVTT

01:40.280 --> 01:42.970
[Fangs of Fortune]

01:43.130 --> 01:45.920
[Episode 1]

01:46.460 --> 01:51.000
[Tiandu City, the 13th year of Zhenyuan]

02:13.670 --> 02:15.020
It's raining again.

02:15.510 --> 02:17.440
This business can't go on.

02:22.030 --> 02:24.030
Heaven, help me.

02:24.030 --> 02:25.100
Please stop raining.

02:25.100 --> 02:26.510
Please stop raining.

02:32.110 --> 02:33.270
The weather is clear

02:33.270 --> 02:34.730
without a cloud in the sky.

02:34.790 --> 02:35.470
It's great.

02:42.150 --> 02:43.070
Boss,

02:43.120 --> 02:44.070
one bowl of plain noodles.

02:44.070 --> 02:44.920
Thank you.

02:57.840 --> 02:59.440
Here are your plain noodles.

03:00.090 --> 03:01.350
Enjoy your meal, miss.

03:03.930 --> 03:05.120
Excuse me, dear.

03:06.110 --> 03:07.100
I can't read.

03:07.830 --> 03:09.660
Could you tell me if this says

03:09.870 --> 03:12.310
salt or sugar?

03:13.730 --> 03:15.970
[Salt]

03:16.270 --> 03:17.270
Salt.

03:35.310 --> 03:37.570
I'm here to pay a visit to Mr. Zhuo Yichen.

03:38.290 --> 03:40.090
Would you please announce me?

03:42.430 --> 03:43.790
Where's your calling card?

03:43.790 --> 03:44.720
I don't have one.

03:45.120 --> 03:46.850
Then what are you visiting for?

03:48.370 --> 03:49.930
I'm bored

03:50.470 --> 03:52.730
and want to have a drink with Mr. Zhuo.

03:52.750 --> 03:54.470
Mr. Zhuo is very busy.

03:54.579 --> 03:56.070
He has no time for drinking.

03:56.070 --> 03:58.390
I've seen many men like you who admire him

03:58.390 --> 04:00.250
and come here because of his reputation.

04:00.250 --> 04:01.030
Leave now.

04:02.560 --> 04:04.330
But I'm not a man.

04:10.400 --> 04:11.830
I'm a demon.

04:12.670 --> 04:14.030
Go and tell him.

04:14.800 --> 04:16.510
Tell Mr. Zhuo Yichen

04:17.829 --> 04:20.160
that the demon he's always wanted to kill,

04:22.150 --> 04:23.150
Zhu Yan…

04:23.510 --> 04:25.420
Zhu...

04:28.670 --> 04:30.390
Has come to see him.

04:31.910 --> 04:32.970
Mr. Zhuo,

04:33.010 --> 04:34.290
Zhu Yan is here!

04:34.310 --> 04:35.310
Mr. Zhuo!

04:41.130 --> 04:42.980
[Demon Hunting Bureau]

04:47.409 --> 04:48.830
[Demon Hunting Bureau]

04:49.870 --> 04:50.990
Thank you, dear.

04:52.830 --> 04:54.880
You're quite pretty,

04:55.030 --> 04:56.159
so why

04:56.340 --> 04:58.130
are you wearing a hat and veil?

04:59.550 --> 05:01.300
The sun is so strong.

05:01.320 --> 05:03.250
I'm afraid my face would get tanned

05:03.490 --> 05:06.560
and no amount of pearl powder could restore it then.

05:07.640 --> 05:08.650
That makes sense.

05:10.950 --> 05:13.670
Could you get me a pair of chopsticks then?

06:13.360 --> 06:14.200
As expected,

06:14.260 --> 06:16.990
the prettier they are, the better liars they are.

06:17.720 --> 06:19.760
But it was you who lied first, sister.

06:19.760 --> 06:21.330
You have a pen in your hair,

06:21.360 --> 06:23.220
yet you told me you couldn't read.

06:23.360 --> 06:25.160
You're much naughtier than I am.

06:25.740 --> 06:26.540
Am I naughty?

06:35.310 --> 06:36.120
What…

06:37.580 --> 06:39.100
What's this?

06:39.120 --> 06:40.790
It's a special drug for catching demons,

06:40.790 --> 06:42.140
Huanling Powder.

06:42.710 --> 06:44.050
It works every time,

06:44.250 --> 06:46.110
and can cure the disease of lying.

07:17.600 --> 07:18.490
Three,

07:19.830 --> 07:20.630
two,

07:22.030 --> 07:22.630
one.

07:22.910 --> 07:27.910
♫Heartlessness births a dream♫

07:27.950 --> 07:31.220
♫The dawn stings without hesitation♫

07:31.260 --> 07:34.310
♫The world and universe sing for me♫

07:34.380 --> 07:37.020
♫Spring, summer, autumn, winter; everything becomes nothing♫

07:36.990 --> 07:37.790
Oh,

07:39.040 --> 07:40.710
the Cloud Light Sword of the Bingyi Clan

07:40.710 --> 07:42.470
is actually in your hands.

07:43.230 --> 07:45.830
You are truly extraordinary, Mr. Zhuo Yichen.

07:55.700 --> 07:56.750
How dare a demon

07:56.750 --> 07:58.310
utter my name?

08:36.700 --> 08:41.870
♫Heartlessness births a dream♫

08:41.909 --> 08:45.020
♫The dawn stings without hesitation♫

08:45.110 --> 08:48.120
♫The world and universe sing for me♫

08:48.180 --> 08:49.650
♫Spring, summer, autumn, winter; everything becomes nothing♫

08:49.670 --> 08:54.590
♫Heartlessness births a dream♫

08:54.590 --> 08:57.880
♫My definitions for right and wrong differ♫

08:57.920 --> 09:00.990
♫Bury your pride in the raging river♫

09:01.030 --> 09:03.030
♫Lamenting that all beings are powerless♫

09:03.100 --> 09:07.720
♫Heartlessness births a dream♫

09:09.750 --> 09:12.110
Your Demon Hunting Bureau has been in decline for eight years.

09:12.110 --> 09:14.240
Grass has even grown on the roof tiles.

09:14.270 --> 09:17.430
Recently, you finally have a chance to rebuild it,

09:17.990 --> 09:20.250
so I came specially to congratulate you.

09:20.950 --> 09:23.230
Yet you greet me with a sword.

09:26.030 --> 09:26.920
Zhu Yan,

09:28.220 --> 09:29.950
your evil deeds are countless.

09:30.750 --> 09:31.470
Today,

09:33.100 --> 09:35.610
I will kill you and take my revenge.

09:37.150 --> 09:38.430
You want to kill me?

09:39.670 --> 09:42.020
One Cloud Light Sword won't be enough.

09:47.840 --> 09:49.120
Move.

10:59.230 --> 11:00.360
Commander Zhuo,

11:00.460 --> 11:01.750
spare the man!

11:09.900 --> 11:11.010
Spare the man!

11:12.280 --> 11:13.500
Sparing men is fine,

11:14.790 --> 11:16.140
but not demons.

11:17.110 --> 11:17.750
Yes.

11:18.760 --> 11:19.470
Rigorous.

11:20.870 --> 11:22.830
Mr. Zhuo, you are very rigorous.

11:23.200 --> 11:25.070
Let's put aside whether he's human or demon for now.

11:25.070 --> 11:25.790
I ask you,

11:26.470 --> 11:28.750
is everything in this letter true?

11:29.920 --> 11:31.460
Of course it's true.

11:32.190 --> 11:33.780
I'm not a Deceptive Beast.

11:34.030 --> 11:36.290
You're certainly not a Deceptive Beast.

11:37.350 --> 11:39.400
You're a white monkey.

11:39.830 --> 11:40.900
White ape.

11:41.590 --> 11:42.350
Ape.

11:48.390 --> 11:49.150
Monkey.

11:50.350 --> 11:51.230
I'm a monkey.

11:57.150 --> 11:59.190
You're from Chongwu Camp?

11:59.590 --> 12:01.270
With my meager skills,

12:01.270 --> 12:03.470
how could I possibly be from Chongwu Camp?

12:03.470 --> 12:05.870
I'm just interested in demons, that's all.

12:07.150 --> 12:08.750
You're not afraid of demons?

12:09.270 --> 12:11.630
You're just a little rabbit who loves to lie.

12:11.630 --> 12:12.660
I, Wen Xiao,

12:12.660 --> 12:14.190
have nothing to fear.

12:16.980 --> 12:18.670
So you are Wen Xiao?

12:22.230 --> 12:23.310
Seems like

12:23.310 --> 12:25.030
I really am famous among demons.

12:25.030 --> 12:25.870
No.

12:25.950 --> 12:27.070
You're just a

12:27.070 --> 12:29.190
little girl no one's ever heard of.

12:29.190 --> 12:30.380
Nobody knows you.

12:32.750 --> 12:34.380
You liar.

12:35.430 --> 12:36.860
You know me?

12:37.070 --> 12:37.910
Deceptive Beasts

12:37.910 --> 12:39.030
look innocent

12:39.030 --> 12:40.510
with a human face that speaks well,

12:40.510 --> 12:41.830
saying one thing but meaning another,

12:41.830 --> 12:43.760
speaking of evil but meaning well.

12:44.380 --> 12:46.030
You're the best liar of all.

12:46.030 --> 12:46.750
Am I right?

12:47.580 --> 12:48.290
Wrong.

12:48.390 --> 12:49.550
Completely wrong.

12:51.630 --> 12:54.480
Although Deceptive Beasts are not fierce creatures…

12:54.480 --> 12:56.480
Then why are you still capturing me?

12:57.230 --> 12:59.640
Although Deceptive Beasts are not fierce creatures,

12:59.640 --> 13:01.140
but you committed murder because of your beauty

13:01.140 --> 13:02.390
disturbing the people's peace,

13:02.390 --> 13:04.190
so you still need to be captured.

13:05.950 --> 13:07.010
Half a year ago,

13:07.070 --> 13:08.680
you disguised yourself as a merchant

13:08.680 --> 13:11.670
and swindled ten taels of gold from rice merchant Mr. Zhang.

13:11.670 --> 13:14.170
I'll take these ten taels of gold first.

13:14.790 --> 13:15.850
Please take a look.

13:16.390 --> 13:17.120
Keep it safe.

13:17.510 --> 13:18.710
The rice cargo ship

13:18.710 --> 13:20.840
will dock in about two hours.

13:20.990 --> 13:22.190
Wish you prosperity.

13:24.230 --> 13:25.350
A month ago,

13:26.120 --> 13:27.070
you deceived again,

13:27.070 --> 13:30.400
winning the heart of the talented Wang from Qingxin Studio.

13:32.750 --> 13:33.830
Young Master Wang,

13:34.430 --> 13:36.950
let me stay by your side forever,

13:37.150 --> 13:38.750
brewing tea for you,

13:39.110 --> 13:40.150
grinding ink,

13:40.260 --> 13:41.120
boiling wine,

13:41.470 --> 13:42.730
and adding fragrance.

13:42.870 --> 13:43.880
Very good.

13:46.670 --> 13:48.530
Would you like to add some laurel?

13:49.680 --> 13:50.880
Do you know

13:51.430 --> 13:53.230
the flower language of laurels?

13:59.450 --> 14:01.780
Now, Mr. Zhang has suffered heavy losses.

14:01.870 --> 14:05.130
His wife suspected he's using money to care for a mistress.

14:05.240 --> 14:07.720
He had no choice but to report to the authorities to arrest you.

14:07.720 --> 14:11.200
[Selling Grains]

14:08.070 --> 14:09.230
You old thing,

14:09.230 --> 14:10.390
you're shameless!

14:10.390 --> 14:11.330
I'm going to report this to the authorities.

14:11.330 --> 14:12.990
I'm going to report this to the authorities.

14:12.990 --> 14:14.700
As for the talented Wang?

14:15.230 --> 14:17.070
You deceived him and stole his heart.

14:17.070 --> 14:19.010
He's been devastated ever since,

14:19.230 --> 14:21.310
crying his eyes out every day.

14:25.400 --> 14:28.710
Beautiful women have always been fickle.

14:29.910 --> 14:30.990
Xiao'e,

14:31.830 --> 14:34.300
you're really something.

14:34.830 --> 14:37.030
Sister, don't listen to such nonsense.

14:37.030 --> 14:39.910
Mr. Zhang is known as a great philanthropist in the area.

14:39.910 --> 14:41.950
I heard this year's drought led to a poor harvest,

14:41.950 --> 14:43.390
so he spent a lot of money

14:43.390 --> 14:45.030
to stockpile grain from nearby towns

14:45.030 --> 14:46.290
and villages.

14:46.440 --> 14:48.370
He says when grain becomes scarce,

14:48.390 --> 14:50.810
so that the people in Tiandu can have food.

14:51.030 --> 14:52.590
How could I possibly deceive him?

14:52.590 --> 14:56.120
I swear if I deceive a good person, I'll get struck by lightning.

15:03.060 --> 15:04.890
The rain is getting heavier.

15:05.190 --> 15:07.130
Why are you closing your umbrella?

15:07.390 --> 15:08.110
Yes.

15:08.630 --> 15:09.960
I understand now.

15:11.270 --> 15:12.670
Heaven understands too.

15:15.910 --> 15:17.630
Mr. Zhang is hoarding goods

15:17.630 --> 15:19.230
to make exorbitant profits.

15:19.270 --> 15:20.510
He's a profiteer.

15:24.960 --> 15:26.500
And what about Wang?

15:28.630 --> 15:30.030
Young Master Wang

15:30.080 --> 15:31.680
is incredibly talented.

15:31.870 --> 15:33.590
From courtesans in brothels

15:33.630 --> 15:35.200
to daughters of wealthy families,

15:35.200 --> 15:38.330
everyone is captivated by his knowledge and character.

15:38.830 --> 15:41.290
Young Master Wang has admirers everywhere.

15:41.310 --> 15:42.070
For my sake,

15:42.070 --> 15:44.030
he abandoned his former lover.

15:44.270 --> 15:45.030
I see.

15:45.720 --> 15:47.540
Young Master Wang is fickle,

15:47.540 --> 15:48.590
hypocritical,

15:48.820 --> 15:50.390
and a scoundrel who is all show

15:50.390 --> 15:52.150
but no substance.

15:53.190 --> 15:54.350
What are you saying?

15:54.350 --> 15:56.160
Our love is true and strong.

15:56.990 --> 15:57.480
Yes.

15:57.660 --> 15:58.470
You two

15:58.530 --> 15:59.790
are just pretending.

16:00.530 --> 16:01.170
Let's go.

16:01.590 --> 16:03.870
I really haven't done anything wrong.

16:03.950 --> 16:05.430
You know very well

16:05.430 --> 16:06.670
that this is wrong.

16:07.230 --> 16:08.380
The world is full of all kinds of people,

16:08.380 --> 16:09.910
both good and evil.

16:10.110 --> 16:11.870
Bad people will face human laws

16:11.870 --> 16:13.800
and receive their due punishment.

16:13.990 --> 16:15.430
You've deceived people for money and lust.

16:15.430 --> 16:17.230
Although your initial intentions may have been good,

16:17.230 --> 16:19.230
you've still disturbed the peace of the mortal world.

16:19.230 --> 16:20.890
You should also face justice.

16:22.720 --> 16:25.280
Don't worry. It's not a serious matter.

16:25.350 --> 16:26.190
You'll be imprisoned for a few months

16:26.190 --> 16:28.250
and then sent back to the Wilderness.

16:31.110 --> 16:32.710
Why are you so nervous?

16:33.020 --> 16:33.790
No.

16:33.870 --> 16:34.510
Sister,

16:34.630 --> 16:35.390
look.

16:37.190 --> 16:37.910
Hya!

16:38.710 --> 16:39.510
Hya!

16:41.030 --> 16:41.830
Hya!

16:43.030 --> 16:45.160
The people from Chongwu Camp are here.

16:46.700 --> 16:47.850
Easy.

16:49.760 --> 16:51.200
Hand over the demon to us.

16:52.520 --> 16:54.580
I am the Archivist of the Demon Hunting Bureau.

16:54.580 --> 16:57.790
I have the authority to take the Deceptive Beast back to the Demon Hunting Bureau.

16:57.790 --> 16:59.250
The Demon Hunting Bureau?

16:59.900 --> 17:01.760
The moss and cobwebs in your courtyard

17:01.760 --> 17:03.220
must be quite thick by now.

17:03.280 --> 17:05.670
It's a dilapidated place that exists in name only.

17:05.670 --> 17:07.680
You dare to compete for authority with the Chongwu Camp?

17:07.680 --> 17:08.540
Step aside now.

17:10.940 --> 17:12.150
The Deceptive Beast is weak

17:12.150 --> 17:13.810
and has little magical power.

17:14.069 --> 17:15.550
Although it lies,

17:15.569 --> 17:17.550
it only deceives those who do evil.

17:17.900 --> 17:20.000
It should be punished according to its crimes,

17:20.000 --> 17:22.000
but its crimes don't warrant death.

17:22.420 --> 17:24.630
You were saved by a demon when you were young,

17:24.630 --> 17:26.710
so you've always had a soft spot for demons.

17:26.710 --> 17:29.370
As a result, you've let many evil demons escape.

17:30.060 --> 17:31.520
However, eight years ago,

17:31.590 --> 17:33.130
the extremely evil demon Zhu Yan

17:33.130 --> 17:35.530
caused heavy casualties to the Demon Hunting Bureau,

17:35.530 --> 17:37.140
almost destroying it.

17:37.630 --> 17:38.960
If he were here,

17:39.390 --> 17:41.560
would you still plead for him?

17:44.510 --> 17:46.040
The words of a vicious beast

17:46.760 --> 17:48.620
are absolutely not to be trusted.

17:49.830 --> 17:50.990
Today,

17:52.110 --> 17:54.510
I will definitely kill you to take revenge.

17:57.440 --> 17:58.990
My patience has run out.

17:59.010 --> 18:00.380
Mine ran out long ago.

18:01.650 --> 18:04.220
If Mr. Fan hadn't just appeared to stop me...

18:15.580 --> 18:17.120
You can kill me.

18:18.050 --> 18:20.830
But all the guards here—

18:22.850 --> 18:24.750
the four on the roof,

18:25.430 --> 18:27.940
seven behind the corridor,

18:28.650 --> 18:30.560
five by the pillars—

18:33.630 --> 18:35.590
a total of sixteen lives

18:35.590 --> 18:38.200
would all die with me.

18:39.760 --> 18:42.710
Their hearts would burst and they would perish.

18:45.450 --> 18:47.050
Like this.

18:57.600 --> 19:00.000
The demon beast Zhu Yan kills and does evil,

19:00.600 --> 19:03.000
but the Chongwu Camp kills to stop killing.

19:03.010 --> 19:05.140
How is that any different from Zhu Yan?

19:05.350 --> 19:06.390
Enough talk.

19:06.910 --> 19:07.790
Attack!

19:26.550 --> 19:27.610
Sister,

19:28.110 --> 19:30.310
are you still acting at a time like this?

19:31.350 --> 19:32.870
I'm not acting.

19:33.560 --> 19:34.860
Are you alright?

19:36.580 --> 19:37.590
Go.

19:43.340 --> 19:44.130
Go!

19:45.790 --> 19:46.580
Go!

20:01.210 --> 20:02.450
Hurry!

20:27.960 --> 20:29.820
The Chongwu Camp is ordered to eliminate demons.

20:29.820 --> 20:31.340
It is our duty.

20:31.370 --> 20:32.850
Weapons are merciless.

20:32.950 --> 20:35.630
You people from the Demon Hunting Bureau insist on obstructing us.

20:35.630 --> 20:39.150
Any injuries sustained are not the responsibility of the Chongwu Camp.

20:39.150 --> 20:40.110
Farewell.

20:40.790 --> 20:41.630
Hya!

20:42.070 --> 20:42.710
Hya!

20:46.990 --> 20:47.860
Sister.

20:52.650 --> 20:53.710
Thank you.

20:57.670 --> 20:59.190
Are you blaming me?

21:08.240 --> 21:09.760
Indeed, it is my fault.

21:12.950 --> 21:13.830
I'm sorry.

21:16.210 --> 21:17.880
I'm too useless.

21:24.210 --> 21:26.510
♫The little city♫

21:26.540 --> 21:28.090
♫Traps♫

21:28.090 --> 21:30.200
♫The little us♫

21:30.510 --> 21:33.460
♫Going around and around♫

21:33.910 --> 21:35.250
♫Dusk and dawn♫

21:36.400 --> 21:38.600
♫The heavy door♫

21:38.890 --> 21:39.830
♫Who is♫

21:40.360 --> 21:42.270
♫Waiting foolishly♫

21:42.760 --> 21:47.760
♫Reluctant, not asking, unreconciled, unwilling♫

21:49.010 --> 21:51.070
♫The pillow of the past♫

21:51.350 --> 21:52.410
♫Still has♫

21:52.740 --> 21:54.700
♫The warmth of the dream♫

21:54.980 --> 21:57.110
♫The dust from yesterday♫

21:57.410 --> 22:00.100
♫Covering my eyes♫

22:01.270 --> 22:03.300
♫The person in the dream♫

22:03.490 --> 22:04.740
♫Is silent♫

22:04.790 --> 22:07.050
♫Waiting with each step♫

22:07.460 --> 22:12.690
♫Refuses to leave, refuses to turn around♫

22:13.530 --> 22:17.080
♫The spring breeze, she seems to have♫

22:17.410 --> 22:19.540
♫Too much on her mind♫

22:19.770 --> 22:24.160
♫There's a blank spot♫

22:25.870 --> 22:27.340
♫The human world♫

22:27.500 --> 22:29.610
♫The clouds in the sky♫

22:29.710 --> 22:31.910
♫The end of the bitter sea♫

22:31.970 --> 22:33.290
♫A dream♫

22:33.550 --> 22:34.850
♫A pair of hands♫

22:35.070 --> 22:37.160
♫A cup of wine♫

22:38.910 --> 22:40.440
I'll count down from three.

22:41.070 --> 22:43.320
Will you sheathe your sword or not?

22:45.590 --> 22:46.590
Three.

22:51.230 --> 22:52.230
Two.

22:57.440 --> 22:58.430
One.

23:11.470 --> 23:12.590
Does it feel bad?

23:13.550 --> 23:15.220
Good.

23:16.270 --> 23:18.140
Nine out of ten

23:19.230 --> 23:20.910
worldly affairs

23:21.510 --> 23:23.510
don't go according to one's wishes.

23:25.010 --> 23:26.160
Mr. Zhuo,

23:28.540 --> 23:30.310
you'd better get used to it.

23:30.910 --> 23:32.500
You despicable villain!

23:33.880 --> 23:35.430
One day,

23:36.180 --> 23:38.000
I will use the Cloud Light Sword

23:39.040 --> 23:41.150
to pierce your heart.

23:51.970 --> 23:53.710
Like this?

23:55.910 --> 23:58.170
I already told you earlier.

24:00.070 --> 24:00.780
You

24:02.840 --> 24:04.750
can't kill me.

24:08.670 --> 24:09.790
Zhu Yan!

24:09.810 --> 24:10.610
What's wrong?

24:10.680 --> 24:12.720
Does it feel even worse now?

24:16.790 --> 24:17.820
Zhuo,

24:18.580 --> 24:20.710
the bigger picture is more important.

24:21.600 --> 24:22.780
Zhu Yan,

24:23.400 --> 24:25.760
what exactly are you up to?

24:43.300 --> 24:46.960
You proposed to the court to rebuild the Demon Hunting Bureau.

24:47.720 --> 24:50.720
Although the Prime Minister strongly vouched for it,

24:51.410 --> 24:53.990
the Chongwu Camp is interfering.

24:54.630 --> 24:56.960
King Xiang hasn't given his approval yet.

24:57.270 --> 24:58.950
I came here today

25:00.000 --> 25:02.750
to give you a gift.

25:05.990 --> 25:07.590
What gift?

25:10.470 --> 25:11.340
Me.

25:13.610 --> 25:15.720
Capture the great demon Zhu Yan

25:16.990 --> 25:19.020
and bring him to justice.

25:19.800 --> 25:21.610
Get your credit and reward.

25:25.520 --> 25:27.200
Mr. Zhuo,

25:28.740 --> 25:29.930
are you satisfied

25:30.950 --> 25:32.720
with this gift?

25:32.750 --> 25:34.740
Not satisfied enough.

25:35.650 --> 25:37.160
Still not enough?

25:39.980 --> 25:42.220
You are truly greedy.

25:44.320 --> 25:47.750
Then how can I satisfy you?

25:49.630 --> 25:50.910
Are you satisfied now?

25:52.150 --> 25:53.990
I will kill you sooner or later.

25:58.750 --> 26:00.010
I hope you

26:00.650 --> 26:01.840
will keep your word.

26:15.710 --> 26:16.440
Ms. Wen,

26:16.500 --> 26:17.830
you're finally back.

26:17.950 --> 26:19.560
Why is your face so pale?

26:19.830 --> 26:21.080
Is something wrong?

26:22.710 --> 26:23.350
demons.

26:24.650 --> 26:25.650
There are demons?

26:28.700 --> 26:30.480
If there is a demon in the Demon Hunting Bureau,

26:30.480 --> 26:32.340
then this demon must be very bold.

26:32.880 --> 26:34.120
Not only is he bold,

26:34.300 --> 26:35.830
he's big all over.

26:36.800 --> 26:37.970
He's a great demon.

26:39.440 --> 26:40.170
Oh.

26:40.620 --> 26:42.020
What kind of great demon?

26:42.380 --> 26:43.190
I don't know,

26:43.960 --> 26:45.780
but I heard Mr. Zhuo call him…

26:46.890 --> 26:47.780
Call him...

26:48.720 --> 26:50.010
Call him Zhu Yan.

27:15.880 --> 27:17.250
He has a first and last name.

27:17.250 --> 27:18.750
His household registration can be checked.

27:18.750 --> 27:20.340
He's a resident of Tiandu.

27:20.360 --> 27:21.580
Zhao Yuanzhou,

27:21.700 --> 27:23.170
twenty-nine years old.

27:23.840 --> 27:25.030
He really is a demon.

27:25.240 --> 27:26.640
An extremely evil demon.

27:26.960 --> 27:28.390
His cultivation is profound.

27:28.390 --> 27:29.760
Taking human form

27:30.030 --> 27:31.430
is not difficult for him.

27:32.430 --> 27:34.000
Why can't your Cloud Light Sword

27:34.000 --> 27:35.280
kill him?

27:36.670 --> 27:37.400
I don't know.

27:37.890 --> 27:39.120
Do you want to know?

27:42.930 --> 27:45.030
You're eavesdropping on our conversation.

27:45.030 --> 27:45.870
Despicable.

27:47.030 --> 27:48.030
Eavesdropping?

27:48.510 --> 27:50.080
I didn't even move.

27:50.200 --> 27:52.290
Mr. Fan and I were whispering,

27:52.360 --> 27:53.650
yet you could hear us.

27:54.800 --> 27:56.530
You're not a monkey.

27:56.790 --> 27:57.700
You're a dog.

27:57.810 --> 27:59.870
I think dogs have a sharp sense of smell.

27:59.870 --> 28:00.400
You—

28:00.900 --> 28:02.230
Mr. Zhuo, don't forget.

28:02.670 --> 28:04.710
I am a thousand-year-old great demon.

28:04.710 --> 28:06.350
My five senses are extraordinary.

28:06.350 --> 28:08.150
No matter how far away you stand,

28:08.500 --> 28:11.490
it's as if you're...

28:13.970 --> 28:15.860
whispering right next to my ear.

28:16.240 --> 28:17.020
How dare you!

28:17.160 --> 28:18.820
Who's whispering in your ear?

28:21.130 --> 28:23.130
Do you want to know the answer or not?

28:23.150 --> 28:24.720
You keep getting off topic.

28:24.950 --> 28:26.030
So annoying.

28:28.160 --> 28:29.760
Just say what you have to say.

28:30.500 --> 28:32.700
You are a descendant of the Bingyi Clan.

28:34.850 --> 28:36.390
The bloodline of the Bingyi Clan

28:36.390 --> 28:39.720
has always been the nemesis of the demons of the Wilderness.

28:40.460 --> 28:41.830
The power of the Cloud Light Sword

28:41.830 --> 28:44.100
is enough to slay gods and demons.

28:44.430 --> 28:45.360
However…

28:50.100 --> 28:51.130
However what?

28:52.560 --> 28:54.220
You're using it incorrectly.

28:57.570 --> 28:58.630
How should I use it?

28:59.790 --> 29:02.320
This is the highest secret of the Bingyi Clan.

29:02.470 --> 29:05.070
I must whisper it to Mr. Zhuo.

29:05.370 --> 29:07.500
It must not be overheard by outsiders.

29:12.280 --> 29:14.010
What a pity about these chains.

29:15.240 --> 29:16.040
Zhuo.

29:18.200 --> 29:19.430
Demons are cunning.

29:19.430 --> 29:20.390
Don't be fooled.

29:20.680 --> 29:21.600
Zhao Yuanzhou.

29:21.660 --> 29:23.270
You said in your letter

29:23.290 --> 29:24.730
that you could help the Demon Hunting Bureau

29:24.730 --> 29:26.190
solve the recent cases in Tiandu City

29:26.190 --> 29:29.190
of water ghosts abducting brides and killing people.

29:29.390 --> 29:30.950
Is this true?

29:31.030 --> 29:32.250
Why would you help the Demon Hunting Bureau

29:32.250 --> 29:33.770
for no good reason?

29:33.940 --> 29:35.800
You must have an ulterior motive.

29:36.100 --> 29:37.810
I have no desires or demands.

29:37.950 --> 29:40.810
I sincerely want to help the Demon Hunting Bureau.

29:41.540 --> 29:43.270
For many years, the Chongwu Camp

29:43.270 --> 29:45.380
has been wantonly slaughtering demons and beasts.

29:45.380 --> 29:46.640
As a great demon,

29:47.390 --> 29:50.020
I naturally want to help the lesser demons take revenge.

29:50.020 --> 29:51.260
The enemy of my enemy

29:51.510 --> 29:52.550
is my friend.

29:53.230 --> 29:54.390
This is written in

29:54.390 --> 29:56.000
your human military strategy,

29:56.000 --> 29:56.810
right?

29:58.790 --> 30:00.070
But eight years ago,

30:01.150 --> 30:02.710
the Demon Hunting Bureau was destroyed

30:02.710 --> 30:04.640
and the Chongwu Camp gained power.

30:06.730 --> 30:09.200
This was all thanks to you.

30:11.630 --> 30:14.190
The deep feud for killing my father and brothers

30:14.190 --> 30:15.960
is something I must avenge.

30:17.670 --> 30:20.010
Anyone can help the Demon Hunting Bureau,

30:22.590 --> 30:24.350
except you.

30:25.730 --> 30:27.960
Don't you mortals have a saying

30:28.590 --> 30:29.230
that goes,

30:30.070 --> 30:31.820
"To know one's fault and be willing to change

30:31.820 --> 30:33.320
is the greatest virtue"?

30:36.920 --> 30:40.050
Are you really willing to help the Demon Hunting Bureau?

30:41.340 --> 30:42.960
I'll give my all

30:43.220 --> 30:45.080
and dedicate myself completely.

30:46.620 --> 30:48.350
However, I have one condition.

30:50.300 --> 30:52.700
You just said you had no desires or demands.

30:53.630 --> 30:55.560
Indeed, your mouth is full of lies.

30:55.600 --> 30:56.860
What's the condition?

30:58.990 --> 31:01.450
I want someone from the Demon Hunting Bureau

31:02.620 --> 31:04.880
to accompany me in investigating cases.

31:05.860 --> 31:06.980
Who?

31:08.740 --> 31:10.310
It's someone you both know.

31:11.630 --> 31:13.480
Commander Fan Ying,

31:13.550 --> 31:15.030
it's your daughter,

31:16.530 --> 31:18.230
Ms. Wen Xiao.

31:21.460 --> 31:22.720
Mr. Zhuo has ordered

31:22.750 --> 31:24.950
that no one is allowed near the dungeon.

31:25.070 --> 31:26.220
Not even me?

31:26.760 --> 31:28.230
Not even you, Ms. Wen.

31:31.150 --> 31:32.300
Don't even think about it.

31:32.300 --> 31:33.760
Don't even think about it?

31:34.650 --> 31:36.310
Not only will I think about it,

31:36.720 --> 31:38.080
but I will also do it.

31:40.680 --> 31:42.600
I'm the one making demands now.

31:44.070 --> 31:46.640
You have no right to say no.

31:49.910 --> 31:50.870
How dare you!

32:30.750 --> 32:31.550
Dream.

32:33.830 --> 32:34.690
Zhao Yuanzhou!

32:37.990 --> 32:38.790
Protect.

32:57.140 --> 32:57.950
Dream.

33:15.060 --> 33:16.060
Do you like

33:16.640 --> 33:17.890
this meeting gift?

33:21.560 --> 33:22.930
Master!

33:23.640 --> 33:24.940
Master!

33:58.740 --> 34:00.740
Why is there blood on the flowers?

34:07.920 --> 34:10.060
Is it Master's blood?

34:24.860 --> 34:26.270
A mortal woman

34:26.560 --> 34:28.060
being so forward.

34:29.980 --> 34:31.510
My body feels weak.

34:31.909 --> 34:33.159
That's why I fell.

34:33.520 --> 34:35.520
Please don't take offense, my lord.

34:36.090 --> 34:37.420
You're not afraid of me?

34:38.139 --> 34:39.460
Why should I be afraid?

34:42.429 --> 34:43.630
I am a demon.

34:45.500 --> 34:46.770
I know.

34:47.190 --> 34:48.150
Great Demon,

34:48.190 --> 34:49.139
Zhu Yan.

34:52.820 --> 34:54.520
You look familiar.

34:55.840 --> 34:57.790
Have we met somewhere before?

34:59.370 --> 35:00.710
How cliché.

35:01.510 --> 35:02.830
Are you being serious?

35:05.290 --> 35:06.130
Hello.

35:07.010 --> 35:08.280
My name is Wen Xiao.

35:09.660 --> 35:10.500
Hello.

35:10.920 --> 35:12.320
My name is Zhao Yuanzhou.

35:15.040 --> 35:17.440
I didn't expect Mr. Zhu Yan to have an alias.

35:18.680 --> 35:20.790
Even a mere cunning rabbit has three burrows.

35:20.790 --> 35:22.000
As a great demon,

35:22.030 --> 35:23.160
having a few aliases

35:23.520 --> 35:24.920
is nothing to brag about.

35:25.440 --> 35:26.830
Mr. Zhao Yuanzhou,

35:27.070 --> 35:28.670
my legs aren't weak anymore.

35:29.000 --> 35:30.440
You can help me up now.

35:31.670 --> 35:32.510
Alright.

35:35.440 --> 35:36.110
Zhu Yan,

35:36.130 --> 35:37.080
let her go.

35:44.030 --> 35:45.030
Did you hear that?

35:45.030 --> 35:46.650
He wants you to let me go.

35:46.840 --> 35:47.800
No way.

35:49.980 --> 35:52.610
Even Mr. Zhuo's Cloud Light Sword couldn't kill me.

35:52.610 --> 35:54.240
Your little dagger—

35:58.710 --> 35:59.780
You won't die,

35:59.810 --> 36:01.150
but it will still hurt, won't it?

36:01.150 --> 36:02.840
Playing dirty, huh?

36:04.370 --> 36:05.820
Then I'll also—

36:11.470 --> 36:13.120
What did you put on the blade?

36:13.140 --> 36:14.400
A sedative for demons,

36:14.410 --> 36:15.530
Huanling Powder.

36:16.270 --> 36:17.280
Tit for tat.

36:17.850 --> 36:19.530
Your flower is beautiful.

36:19.640 --> 36:20.940
I'll take it.

36:27.270 --> 36:29.160
The Huanling Powder won't hold him for long.

36:29.160 --> 36:31.290
Quickly, lock him back in the dungeon.

36:33.480 --> 36:34.240
The dungeon

36:34.670 --> 36:35.740
can't hold him.

36:38.340 --> 36:40.370
He just escaped from there.

36:43.690 --> 36:44.510
Is that so?

36:50.160 --> 36:52.100
Then keep slashing him with the knife.

36:52.100 --> 36:52.990
No, no, no.

36:53.500 --> 36:54.360
Don't slash me.

36:54.830 --> 36:55.930
I'll go back myself.

36:55.930 --> 36:57.130
I promise I won't run.

36:57.530 --> 36:58.730
I'll go back on my own.

36:59.400 --> 37:00.330
Thank you.

37:04.730 --> 37:05.830
I can walk by myself.

37:05.830 --> 37:06.590
Thank you.

37:17.480 --> 37:18.350
Ms. Wen,

37:18.370 --> 37:20.040
here's the demon catalog you asked me to find.

37:20.040 --> 37:20.880
The information on Deceptive Beasts

37:20.880 --> 37:22.080
is all recorded here.

37:29.120 --> 37:30.360
You may go now.

37:30.380 --> 37:31.110
Ms. Wen,

37:31.220 --> 37:32.110
your wound...

37:32.250 --> 37:33.050
It's nothing.

38:05.790 --> 38:07.370
Fierce as a wrathful deity,

38:08.110 --> 38:09.350
engulfed in flames.

38:11.300 --> 38:13.220
Sir, this painting of Zhu Rong

38:13.250 --> 38:14.950
is so lifelike.

38:15.960 --> 38:17.580
My brushwork is ordinary.

38:18.490 --> 38:20.950
This painting excels in its vibrant colors.

38:23.910 --> 38:24.910
Good paint.

38:26.750 --> 38:28.790
It really is good paint.

38:31.930 --> 38:34.260
I heard they caught Zhu Yan.

38:34.760 --> 38:37.090
Zhu Yan is a great demon of the Wilderness.

38:37.490 --> 38:38.580
If he

38:39.150 --> 38:40.840
truly becomes our enemy...

38:42.440 --> 38:43.950
There's no need to worry.

38:44.750 --> 38:47.610
The Demon Hunting Bureau is just a pack of lost dogs.

38:47.630 --> 38:49.790
All I want is Zhao Yuanzhou.

38:50.240 --> 38:53.080
Since he's delivered himself to our doorstep,

38:53.860 --> 38:56.760
my grand plan, years in the making,

38:58.240 --> 39:01.180
can finally be brought to reality.

39:05.720 --> 39:06.740
Deceptive Beasts

39:07.370 --> 39:09.130
look innocent

39:10.700 --> 39:12.330
with a human face that speaks well,

39:12.330 --> 39:13.710
saying one thing but meaning another,

39:13.710 --> 39:15.070
speaking of evil but meaning good.

39:15.070 --> 39:16.630
Born as a Deceptive Beast,

39:16.650 --> 39:18.740
they are destined to speak against their will.

39:18.740 --> 39:21.140
The heart and mouth contradict each other.

39:22.980 --> 39:24.000
Sister,

39:25.820 --> 39:27.030
thank you.

39:32.160 --> 39:33.800
In a Deceptive Beast's life,

39:34.740 --> 39:36.980
they can only follow their true heart

39:35.940 --> 39:38.030
♫The little city♫

39:37.980 --> 39:39.790
and speak their true thoughts

39:38.110 --> 39:39.840
♫Surrounds♫

39:39.810 --> 39:41.470
in the moments before death.

39:39.870 --> 39:42.060
♫The little us♫

39:42.150 --> 39:45.220
♫Going around and around♫

39:45.520 --> 39:46.960
♫Dusk and dawn♫

39:47.380 --> 39:48.750
Born as a Deceptive Beast,

39:48.290 --> 39:50.290
♫The heavy door♫

39:48.940 --> 39:50.670
they are destined to speak against their will.

39:50.670 --> 39:51.990
The heart and mouth contradict each other.

39:50.720 --> 39:51.630
♫Who is♫

39:52.080 --> 39:54.010
♫Waiting foolishly♫

39:53.510 --> 39:55.390
They can only follow their true heart

39:54.370 --> 39:59.000
♫Reluctant, not asking, unreconciled, unwilling♫

39:55.590 --> 39:57.270
and speak their true thoughts

39:57.710 --> 39:59.310
in the moments before death.

40:00.590 --> 40:02.570
♫The pillow of the past♫

40:02.900 --> 40:03.880
♫Still has♫

40:04.020 --> 40:06.370
♫The warmth of the dream♫

40:05.600 --> 40:07.110
Run!

40:06.540 --> 40:08.790
♫The dust from yesterday♫

40:07.520 --> 40:08.670
So, sister,

40:08.880 --> 40:11.870
♫Covering my eyes♫

40:10.830 --> 40:12.490
the "thank you" that I said...

40:12.840 --> 40:14.710
♫The person in the dream♫

40:15.100 --> 40:16.300
♫Is silent♫

40:15.550 --> 40:16.990
was sincere.

40:16.420 --> 40:18.600
♫Waiting with each step♫

40:18.950 --> 40:24.190
♫Refuses to leave, refuses to turn around♫

40:25.140 --> 40:28.660
♫The spring breeze, she seems to have♫

40:28.870 --> 40:31.050
♫Many stories♫

40:31.360 --> 40:35.670
♫There's a name in her heart♫

40:37.530 --> 40:38.870
♫The human world♫

40:38.910 --> 40:41.130
♫The ink is mottled♫

40:41.240 --> 40:43.380
♫Love, hate, absurdity, mistakes♫

40:43.470 --> 40:44.850
♫Can't clearly write it♫

40:45.160 --> 40:46.270
♫Can't completely express it♫

40:46.750 --> 40:48.750
♫This karma♫

42:33.660 --> 42:36.750
[Marriage Letter]

42:40.410 --> 42:44.210
[On the 7th day of the 5th lunar month, the Water Ghost welcomes his bride]
